# Line endings.
#
# The config files in this project are meant to be edited by hand, on a
# Windows laptop, in whatever editor is to hand. Git's default on
# Windows is to check text out with CRLF, which is fine for editing and
# quietly wrong for anything that matches on the text itself.
#
# It cost a build: a check edited consent.yaml by searching for two
# lines of it, found nothing because the file had CRLF, and then tested
# the unedited file and reported that a rule had stopped working.
#
# So every text file is LF, in the repository and in every working tree,
# on every platform. Editors on Windows have handled LF for twenty years.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Left exactly as they are.
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.m4a  binary
*.woff2 binary
